{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>在美國買賣的港股預託證券，與本港收市比較，造價個別發展。</p><p></p><p>滙豐控股收市折合147.37元，比本港收市高1.57元。工商銀行7.44元，低1仙。建設銀行9.79元，高1仙。友邦保險71.74元，低0.36元。港交所372.5元，低0.3元。</p><p></p><p>騰訊控股395.1元，高1.3元。阿里巴巴102.41元，低1.29元。理想汽車45.12元，低0.7元。金沙中國11.34元，低3仙。長和65.92元，低0.33元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T23:21:49.333418+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":204,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T22:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T23:56:09.687841+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T23:17:42.186311+00:00","content_hash":"093c03668982ba57dc41cadf29d85aa9abbb375484b7372185b3a1f21afa1822","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}